      "content": "it's not even about sources or coping. i've tried everything. i've rested, i've talked, i've changed things up... but the weight just stays. it feels like there's this massive debt i can't ever pay off. i'm just so fundamentally broken. i feel like i'm just occupying space that i don't even need anymore. does that make sense?",
